WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:0
Liar’s Deck: play face down, claiming the target
face. A caught lie, or a wrong call, means a pull.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.750 line:0
East picks one card and presses Play, face down.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:22.000 line:0
North presses LIAR and reveals a joker: no lie.
The wrong caller, North, pulls and survives.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000 line:0
Fast-forward: nobody knows who lied before the
reveal. Whoever hits the bullet is out: West.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.300 line:0
South plays face down; East presses LIAR.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:42.999 line:0
It is an A, not the target face: South lied,
pulls the trigger and survives.

00:00:42.999 --> 00:00:55.999 line:0
Fast-forward: North and South are shot out
too, leaving only East.

00:00:55.999 --> 00:01:05.000 line:0
East is the last survivor and wins;
West, North and South were eliminated in order.
